{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Description_Header.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the first look at a condensed version of Dungeon Escape level, giving you a taste of all aspects of the core gameplay. The goal is to allow players to test the gameplay and provide improvements which I can add to the main game which is scheduled for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Features_Header.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo featues the following which I hope to get feedback on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level 1:\u00a0 Dungeon Escape</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement: Keyboard Mouse / Gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pickups - Potions and Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactable objects - Opening / Closing Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic UI - Main menu and ingame menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombie AI enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timer for speed runners as part of a competition for users to post their fastest times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback form for sharing comments and improvements to the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Gameplay_Improve.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback would be greatly appreciated and will help us improve the game as we continue development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/06_Hurt_by_zombies.gif?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3677810?t=1745455398","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/223d4995d99e2c257cf2bf0ece726ef87221f28f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745455398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/aad8d64eccb563773e9f06ef628cbe8330056b20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745455398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/aad8d64eccb563773e9f06ef628cbe8330056b20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745455398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Description_Header.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the first look at a condensed version of Dungeon Escape level, giving you a taste of all aspects of the core gameplay. The goal is to allow players to test the gameplay and provide improvements which I can add to the main game which is scheduled for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Features_Header.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo featues the following which I hope to get feedback on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level 1:\u00a0 Dungeon Escape</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement: Keyboard Mouse / Gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pickups - Potions and Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactable objects - Opening / Closing Gates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basic UI - Main menu and ingame menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombie AI enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timer for speed runners as part of a competition for users to post their fastest times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feedback form for sharing comments and improvements to the game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/Gameplay_Improve.png?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback would be greatly appreciated and will help us improve the game as we continue development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/extras/06_Hurt_by_zombies.gif?t=1745455398\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Cameron Chung"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2543590","name":"Brain Escape"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677810/dfb4fe1e6d3e57ad6a99ff81c3199b8c1095f231/header.jpg?t=1745455398","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127579,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127579/movie480.mp4?t=1745366164","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127579/movie_max.mp4?t=1745366164"},"name":"Brain Escape","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127579/721a3fb3f45afa84fd5add09aec6697478dc4139/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745366164","webm":{"480":"ht